  "text": "SEVERE constipation, dry mouth,indigestion,cough,high fever during sleep, increased muscle aching in my legs, rash, skin peeling off fingers/toes/lips, nausea and vomiting\nThis drug is POISON.\nI am a nurse and have seen many of these symptoms in patients taking chemotherapy.\nThe skin peeling was especially distressing because my fingertips and lips were extremely sore and sensitive for a long time--\nI quit the drug after 2 weeks (30mg daily) because I could not tolerate any of these side effects.\nI generally tolerate medication well.\nI can't believe this stuff is still on the market.\n",
